                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<ul>\n<li>The results have been obtained by using a commercial solver packages and a commercial simulation package. Hence, we cannot provide code that will run independently.\n<li>Instead, the package contains the specification of the software that has been used, and the model specifications that have been used, along with all results.\n<li>The package includes a file with line by line instructions to be able to replicate.\n</ul>"
